{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15088","headline":"赋得花发上林 · 王表","name":"赋得花发上林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御苑春何早，繁花已绣林。\n笑迎明主仗，香拂美人簪。\n地接楼台近，天垂雨露深。\n晴光来戏蝶，夕景动栖禽。\n欲托凌云势，先开捧日心。\n方知桃李树，从此别成阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王表","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}